title: fires-social-manager
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata from this file.
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: K. S. Ernest
    name-particle: (iFire)
    family-names: Lee
    email: ernest.lee@chibifire.com
    orcid: https://orcid.org/0009-0006-4861-9553
repository-code: https://github.com/fire/fires-social-manager
abstract: >-
  A goal manifest for a social manager built on VRCX data. Renormalizes a VRCX
  SQLite database to Essential Tuple Normal Form with deterministic UUID keys,
  and forecasts availability, relationship decay, world liveliness and personal
  rhythm. The manifest places eleven repositories on the seven sides of a
  hexagonal architecture. The data it reads never leaves the machine it runs on.
keywords:
